tor","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle of Perry County&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 that pair landed at 47% of normal on the middle, and November to December at 53%. So far in 2026, April to May sits at 88% and May to June at 81% on the middle. Grid 24510 had its driest year in 2001 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
